  triage:title "AI43-RBP-F001's request/response error-parity fix has no regression test or lint rule pinning it" ;
  triage:description "ruthless-boundary-qa (AI43-QA-2) confirmed AI43-RSH-001 and AI43-RBP-F001 are both genuinely fixed on commit 12f1260a, but noted the recovery-text parity fix in crates/atm-core/src/api/http_frame_reader.rs has no dedicated test asserting FrameKind::Response error sites carry the same 'Recovery:' guidance as FrameKind::Request sites, and no mechanical lint rule catches future drift where one FrameKind arm gets validation_with_recovery and its sibling arm doesn't. Recommends a focused unit test plus a possible sc-lint-boundary/just-lint rule flagging asymmetric FrameKind match arms. Not a boundary violation; classified lint_gap, non-blocking." ;
